 x, wq, wk, wv, alpha, beta, n=15)\n    print(f\\\"B{B} L{L:3d} C{C:4d} H{H:2d} D{D}: {ms:8.2f} ms\\\")\n\nPYEOF\npython /tmp/bench_prof.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
